{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t食安中心公布，一個藍鰭吞拿魚樣本被檢出孔雀石綠。中心透過恆常食物監測計劃，從進口層面抽取涉事藍鰭吞拿魚樣本作檢測。結果顯示樣本含孔雀石綠，含量為10億分之1.74。 <br/>\n<br/>\r\n中心已知會涉事進口商有關違規情況，並正追查有關產品的來源和分銷情況。 <br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：任順熙\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T14:02:19.507738+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":124,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T13:27:52+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T01:18:46.698172+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T13:57:47.792121+00:00","content_hash":"843199c3285fbfe93a6aa7f3aa226cb9814f3b2069d2d544d138370888ad8e1c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}